From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yureka Lilian <yureka@cyberchaos.dev>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 16:48:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132: Add the SMC and its mailbox

Describe the T8132 System Management Controller and its ASC mailbox.
The SMC's GPIO controller switches the power of the PCIe Wi-Fi port and
the SMC handles power-off, reboot, the RTC and the power button, so
every T8132 board needs it before it can run from its own storage and
network. Both nodes stay disabled; a board enables them.

[sdolbec: Ported from GravityLinux gravity-m4 commit be925f37d4ef
 ("t8132 smc"), a cherry-pick of Yureka's commit d7525ca925b6 ("t8132
 smc"). Renamed mbox@ to mailbox@ and added status = "disabled", as
 t8140.dtsi does. The original commit carries no Signed-off-by; it is
 forwarded here under DCO clause (b), and Yureka's Signed-off-by should
 be added before this is merged. The J773g runs these nodes, unchanged
 apart from the status, under that kernel.]
Signed-off-by: Sean Dolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi | 29 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi
index afec92a060..72bb9d0e06 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi
@@ -451,6 +451,35 @@
 
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
+
+		smc_mbox: mailbox@38c608000 {
+			compatible = "apple,t8132-asc-mailbox", "apple,asc-mailbox-v4";
+			reg = <0x3 0x8c608000 0x0 0x4000>;
+			interrupt-parent = <&aic>;
+			interrupts = <AIC_IRQ 561 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				     <AIC_IRQ 562 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				     <AIC_IRQ 563 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				     <AIC_IRQ 564 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			interrupt-names = "send-empty", "send-not-empty",
+					  "recv-empty", "recv-not-empty";
+			#mbox-cells = <0>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
+		smc: smc@38c600000 {
+			compatible = "apple,t8132-smc", "apple,t8103-smc";
+			reg = <0x3 0x8c600000 0x0 0x4000>,
+			      <0x3 0x8de00000 0x0 0x100000>;
+			reg-names = "smc", "sram";
+			mboxes = <&smc_mbox>;
+			status = "disabled";
+
+			smc_gpio: gpio {
+				compatible = "apple,smc-gpio";
+				gpio-controller;
+				#gpio-cells = <2>;
+			};
+		};
 	};
 
 	timer {
